{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017606,"chapterID":15000205,"chapterNumber":"II-5","sectionNumber":"25-72","title":"Required Accessory Off-street Loading Berths","officialText":"","previewText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12\n\nIn all districts, as indicated, accessory off-street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall be provided in conformity with the requirements set forth in the following table for all development or enlargement after December 15, 1961, for the uses listed in the table, as a condition precedent to the use of such development or enlargement.\n\nAfter December 15, 1961, if the use of ","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17606-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12</span></p>","plainText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12"},{"id":"zr-17606-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, as indicated, <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off-street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall be provided in conformity with the requirements set forth in the following table for all <strong><em>development</em></strong> or <strong><em>enlargement</em></strong> after December 15, 1961, for the <strong><em>uses</em></strong> listed in the table, as a condition precedent to the <strong><em>use</em></strong> of such <strong><em>development</em></strong> or <strong><em>enlargement</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, as indicated, accessory off-street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall be provided in conformity with the requirements set forth in the following table for all development or enlargement after December 15, 1961, for the uses listed in the table, as a condition precedent to the use of such development or enlargement."},{"id":"zr-17606-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>After December 15, 1961, if the <strong><em>use</em></strong> of any <strong><em>building or other structure</em></strong> is <strong><em>enlarged</em></strong>, the requirements set forth in the table shall apply to the <strong><em>floor area</em></strong> of the <strong><em>enlarged</em></strong> portion of such <strong><em>building</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"After December 15, 1961, if the use of any building or other structure is enlarged, the requirements set forth in the table shall apply to the floor area of the enlarged portion of such building."},{"id":"zr-17606-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>For the purposes of applying the loading requirements of this Chapter, <strong><em>uses</em></strong> are grouped into the following Loading Requirement Categories (LRC).</span></p>","plainText":"For the purposes of applying the loading requirements of this Chapter, uses are grouped into the following Loading Requirement Categories (LRC)."},{"id":"zr-17606-block-005","kind":"html","html":"<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17606-block-006","kind":"table","html":"<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:240px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>Loading Requirement Category</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:383px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:30px; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b><strong><em>Use</em></strong> or Use Group</b></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom:none; width:240px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:26p